warning[NK1233]: `compiler_tests::same[…]` names a type the arguments of the call already say.
  --> tests/type_arguments_on_a_path_warned.nika:7:2
   |
 7 | 	println(compiler_tests::same[i64](3))
   |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: Brackets after a function's name are allowed while their uses are collected; here the arguments already say the type.
   = help: Leave the brackets out, `compiler_tests::same(…)`, or add your use case to https://github.com/Nikaia-Language/Nikaia/issues/514.
